			"notes": "## Changed\n- Updated for **Minecraft 26.3** (Fabric Loader 0.19.5+ / Fabric API 0.161.0+; NeoForge `26.3.0.7-beta`+). Requires Minecraft 26.3.\n\n## Fixed\n- Ported the Fabric farmland mixin to 26.3, where farmland was generalised over a base block: the static `turnToDirt` it intercepted became the instance method `turnToBaseBlock`. Same behaviour — trampling is still cancelled per the config.\n\n## Notes\n- NeoForge for 26.3 is still in **beta**; this build targets `26.3.0.7-beta`.\n- No config or behaviour changes."
		},
